name: ship-pull-request
description: Author, gate, and close out pull requests in any repository. Use when the user asks to open, draft, ready, review, gate, triage, merge, or close out one or many PRs, write or fix a PR description, or check whether a PR is ready to merge.
type: agent-skill
title: Ship Pull Request
